#Permutation Generator
Function generatePermutations(numbers):
    IF numbers has only one number:
        return [numbers]
    permutations = empty list

    FOR each number in numbers:

        remove the current number from numbers
        get all permutations of the remaining numbers
        FOR each permuation:
            add current number to the beginning of permutation
            add permutation to permutations
    return permutations
